# Journal — Server/.gitignore
#
# Before: ignored node_modules, dist, .env, *.log, .DS_Store and data/.
#
# 2026-10-12 (Claude): `data/` matched every folder named data — including src/scripts/data/, so
#   category-departments.ts (needed by the seed script) was never committed and the Render build failed (TS2307).
#   Now /data/ and /Data/ only ignore the dataset folder at the root of Server/.

node_modules
dist
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
# the Kaggle dataset CSVs (~350MB) — anchored with / so src/scripts/data/ is NOT ignored
/data/
/Data/
